{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20081","headline":"汝坟蒙从弟楚材见赠时郊将入秦楚材适楚 · 孟郊","name":"汝坟蒙从弟楚材见赠时郊将入秦楚材适楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝爲主人心，暮爲行客吟。\n汝水忽凄咽，汝风流苦音。\n北阙秦门高，南路楚石深。\n分泪洒白日，离肠绕青岑。\n何以寄远怀，黄鹤能相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20081.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20081","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}